WEBVTT

00:02:16.070 --> 00:02:20.450
<b>Seijumonji High School</b>

00:02:26.000 --> 00:02:30.000
<b>Enter
Here</b>

00:02:30.880 --> 00:02:31.460
<b>Enter
Here</b>

00:02:36.010 --> 00:02:41.390
<b>The weight of love is 400 milliliters</b>

00:02:37.370 --> 00:02:40.820
"The weight of love is 400 milliliters."

00:02:41.300 --> 00:02:43.070
"Yes, love can."

00:02:41.390 --> 00:02:51.650
<b>YES LOVE CAN</b>

00:02:44.570 --> 00:02:50.030
Imagine the blood flowing through my body 
is being injected into someone else's.

00:02:50.030 --> 00:02:51.640
Blood is love.

00:02:51.640 --> 00:02:54.670
You're back again?

00:02:54.670 --> 00:02:57.870
No matter how often you 
come, you still can't.

00:02:58.160 --> 00:03:00.140
No matter what?

00:03:00.140 --> 00:03:02.260
No means no.

00:03:02.260 --> 00:03:04.120
We've explained it to you countless times.

00:03:04.120 --> 00:03:07.870
Aw, come on. You don't have 
to sound like Otaka-san.

00:03:07.870 --> 00:03:10.290
Otaka-san? Who's that?

00:03:10.290 --> 00:03:12.770
Tenth chairwoman of the former 
Japan Socialist Party

00:03:12.770 --> 00:03:14.940
and second leader of the 
Social Democratic Party.

00:03:14.940 --> 00:03:17.890
The first woman to serve as 
the Lower House Speaker.

00:03:17.890 --> 00:03:18.880
She's dead now, though.

00:03:18.880 --> 00:03:21.630
For a high school girl, 
you know some strange facts.

00:03:21.630 --> 00:03:23.890
You can just draw it.

00:03:23.890 --> 00:03:26.260
I'll give you this if you'll just leave.

00:03:26.260 --> 00:03:31.390
Delicious
Milk

00:03:26.520 --> 00:03:30.050
We don't have time to waste on 
a pervert obsessed with blood.

00:03:30.050 --> 00:03:31.390
Next person, please.

00:03:33.330 --> 00:03:36.850
Blood. Blood...

00:03:37.020 --> 00:03:39.310
Yes, yes. I'll draw it right now.

00:03:39.310 --> 00:03:40.320
Have a seat over here.

00:03:43.290 --> 00:03:46.220
An old school beauty in this 
day and age? How unusual.

00:03:46.220 --> 00:03:47.610
Seems foreign, too.

00:03:47.610 --> 00:03:49.590
Foreign? What do you mean by that?

00:03:49.590 --> 00:03:53.530
<i>What's such a frail girl doing giving blood?</i>

00:03:56.130 --> 00:03:58.360
You get out of here.

00:03:58.360 --> 00:03:59.640
I'm drawing some blood for test—

00:03:59.640 --> 00:04:00.480
Huh?

00:04:20.610 --> 00:04:23.150
<b>Blood Donating Enthusiast
Mitsugu Bamba</b>

00:04:32.410 --> 00:04:35.930
<i>I snatched her up in the heat of the moment.</i>

00:04:35.930 --> 00:04:38.570
<i>Should I take her to the hospital?</i>

00:04:38.570 --> 00:04:41.830
<i>She sure is a pretty girl.</i>

00:04:42.320 --> 00:04:45.850
Blood. I want blood.

00:04:45.850 --> 00:04:50.260
You're too weak to give blood.

00:04:50.260 --> 00:04:54.150
Give blood? What does that mean?

00:04:54.150 --> 00:04:56.200
Huh? What does...?

00:04:56.200 --> 00:04:58.620
You didn't come here to give blood?

00:04:58.620 --> 00:05:00.450
What are you talking about?

00:05:00.450 --> 00:05:01.960
Why would I give blood?

00:05:01.960 --> 00:05:04.660
I want to drink blood!

00:05:15.150 --> 00:05:17.940
<i>C-Could it be?</i>

00:05:25.780 --> 00:05:32.340
<i>This is how Mai the vampire and I met.</i>

00:05:40.630 --> 00:05:42.180
Want to try this?

00:05:42.180 --> 00:05:46.370
I've been holding onto it since I drew it 
two weeks ago, so it's coagulated a little.

00:05:46.370 --> 00:05:47.390
Blood?

00:05:54.060 --> 00:05:56.510
<i>She makes it look so good.</i>

00:05:56.770 --> 00:05:58.760
This isn't enough!

00:05:58.760 --> 00:06:01.280
More. More blood.

00:06:01.280 --> 00:06:02.620
I don't have anymore.

00:06:03.460 --> 00:06:05.350
No more?

00:06:06.890 --> 00:06:09.910
Then I bid this world farewell.

00:06:10.250 --> 00:06:12.790
Now that I think about it, 
I lived a short life.

00:06:12.790 --> 00:06:14.820
A short life?

00:06:14.820 --> 00:06:17.760
I thought vampires were immortal.

00:06:19.260 --> 00:06:21.000
Thank you for the meal.

00:06:21.400 --> 00:06:23.600
It was delicious.

00:06:25.740 --> 00:06:26.970
Hold on!

00:06:27.560 --> 00:06:29.920
Come on, bite me.

00:06:29.920 --> 00:06:32.940
Feel free to ignore safe limits and 
drink 400, or even 900 milliliters.

00:06:32.940 --> 00:06:35.510
No. I mustn't do that.

00:06:35.510 --> 00:06:39.500
No? Aren't you a bloodsucking fiend?

00:06:39.500 --> 00:06:42.450
I'm no fiend, but I do 
survive by drinking blood.

00:06:42.450 --> 00:06:44.030
Then go ahead and bite me.

00:06:44.030 --> 00:06:45.320
I can't.

00:06:45.320 --> 00:06:47.430
You can't? Why not?

00:06:47.710 --> 00:06:51.890
If I bite you, you'll not 
only become a vampire,

00:06:51.890 --> 00:06:55.410
but also my servant.

00:06:55.410 --> 00:06:57.000
Servant?

00:06:57.340 --> 00:07:03.060
I lack the dependability and disposition 
to make a human my servant.

00:07:03.060 --> 00:07:05.110
<i>Is dependability really the right word?</i>

00:07:05.110 --> 00:07:06.980
Well, I should go.

00:07:06.980 --> 00:07:09.620
What? You're leaving already?

00:07:09.620 --> 00:07:11.250
Where's your home?

00:07:24.160 --> 00:07:26.260
Transylvania?

00:07:26.260 --> 00:07:30.350
Yes. I am Mai Vlad Transylvania.

00:07:30.350 --> 00:07:35.070
Embarrassingly, I am descended from 
the prestigious Transylvania clan.

00:07:35.070 --> 00:07:38.140
Mai Vlad Transylvania?

00:07:38.140 --> 00:07:39.820
You're a foreigner, after all.

00:07:39.820 --> 00:07:43.470
So, what's the descendant of that 
prestigious clan doing in Japan?

00:07:43.470 --> 00:07:50.210
I don't get along with 
my father's 48th wife.

00:07:51.290 --> 00:07:55.330
You bitch! A mother is obligated 
to feed her daughter!

00:07:55.330 --> 00:08:00.200
Shut up, girl! I wouldn't feed 
you a single drop of blood.

00:08:00.200 --> 00:08:04.380
In this clan, we hunt our own 
prey once we turn 10 years old.

00:08:04.380 --> 00:08:06.210
Stupid slut!

00:08:06.210 --> 00:08:07.770
Ugly goody two-shoes!

00:08:07.770 --> 00:08:13.460
I was supposed to stay with relatives 
residing in Eastern Europe.

00:08:14.110 --> 00:08:19.490
But by some mistake, the container 
I hid inside arrived in Tokyo.

00:08:21.280 --> 00:08:25.720
I've been living in a small 
paper house ever since.

00:08:26.150 --> 00:08:31.370
Since getting into that container, I haven't 
had a single drop of blood, so I...

00:08:34.280 --> 00:08:35.470
I can't.

00:08:36.440 --> 00:08:38.710
I can't do it!

00:08:40.950 --> 00:08:44.020
You can't? But you're a vampire.

00:08:44.020 --> 00:08:46.100
You can't survive without blood.

00:08:46.100 --> 00:08:47.850
Just bite someone.

00:08:47.850 --> 00:08:53.440
But crickets, frogs, and water striders 
are happy because they're alive.

00:08:53.440 --> 00:08:57.830
I couldn't possibly endanger a human life.

00:08:58.170 --> 00:09:00.250
Drink a little at a time.

00:09:00.250 --> 00:09:03.340
You know, neither kill nor let them live.

00:09:03.340 --> 00:09:05.010
I mustn't.

00:09:05.010 --> 00:09:08.990
I'd be ruining another person's life.

00:09:08.990 --> 00:09:11.350
And if the person I bit 
turned out to be evil,

00:09:11.690 --> 00:09:14.760
I'd be creating another wicked vampire.

00:09:15.630 --> 00:09:19.400
You're really okay with me biting you?

00:09:19.400 --> 00:09:20.190
What?

00:09:20.550 --> 00:09:23.040
You don't mind having to bite someone

00:09:23.870 --> 00:09:28.250
every night and suck their blood to survive?

00:09:28.250 --> 00:09:31.880
I'd rather not do that.

00:09:31.880 --> 00:09:33.820
How honest.

00:09:34.220 --> 00:09:37.190
I have no money.

00:09:37.190 --> 00:09:41.840
Unable to bear my hunger any longer, 
while wandering around town,

00:09:41.840 --> 00:09:45.360
I smelled the delicious scent of 
blood coming from that vehicle.

00:09:45.360 --> 00:09:47.690
<i>What an unbelievably timid vampire.</i>

00:09:47.690 --> 00:09:49.990
<i>And she's totally homeless.</i>

00:09:49.990 --> 00:09:53.700
But I should be able to 
survive for some time now.

00:09:54.770 --> 00:09:56.010
Thank you.

00:09:58.000 --> 00:10:00.660
<i>So cute. She's too cute.</i>

00:10:00.660 --> 00:10:02.120
<i>All right, I've decided.</i>

00:10:02.120 --> 00:10:03.870
<i>I'll protect this girl.</i>

00:10:04.260 --> 00:10:06.400
<i>Pops, I'll do it.</i>

00:10:06.400 --> 00:10:08.970
Hey, why don't you take a shower?

00:10:09.600 --> 00:10:11.610
A shower?

00:10:11.610 --> 00:10:14.470
I bet you haven't bathed in days.

00:10:14.950 --> 00:10:16.550
Are you sure?

00:10:21.100 --> 00:10:31.690
<b>Self-censored</b>

00:10:21.540 --> 00:10:23.720
She's so bold.

00:10:35.860 --> 00:10:39.000
<i>A beautiful girl wearing only a men's shirt.</i>

00:10:39.000 --> 00:10:40.590
<i>So sexy.</i>

00:10:40.990 --> 00:10:44.330
I'll be able to rest well tonight.

00:10:44.330 --> 00:10:46.940
I got to drink delicious blood, too.

00:10:46.940 --> 00:10:49.550
I can't thank you enough.

00:10:50.690 --> 00:10:54.820
Actually, I was thinking 
instead of just tonight,

00:10:55.340 --> 00:10:58.960
you could stay here forever.

00:10:59.290 --> 00:11:01.180
What? Forever?

00:11:01.550 --> 00:11:06.340
My dad's a scholar. He's currently 
on a business trip overseas.

00:11:06.340 --> 00:11:07.980
We've got a spare room.

00:11:08.480 --> 00:11:12.060
I thought you could stay 
as long as you'd like.

00:11:13.730 --> 00:11:16.480
You don't have anywhere else to go, right?

00:11:18.350 --> 00:11:20.800
So kind.

00:11:20.800 --> 00:11:22.390
To be perfectly honest...

00:11:22.390 --> 00:11:24.390
<i>Well, it's not that big a revelation.</i>

00:11:24.750 --> 00:11:28.440
Lucky for you, I'm a blood-obsessed 
blood donating enthusiast.

00:11:28.440 --> 00:11:31.090
I bet I'll be able to help you.

00:11:31.520 --> 00:11:33.820
Such powerful words.

00:11:33.820 --> 00:11:35.930
I can trust you.

00:11:35.930 --> 00:11:39.540
But I may not be able to 
repay you in any way.

00:11:39.850 --> 00:11:41.970
<i>"Wow!"</i>

00:11:41.970 --> 00:11:45.170
<i>I bet that's how a man 
would react to that pose.</i>

00:11:45.170 --> 00:11:48.670
<i>It's rather flirtatious, 
but it's certainly convincing.</i>

00:11:49.600 --> 00:11:50.960
Good night.

00:11:51.510 --> 00:11:55.210
What? You don't need to sleep in the closet.

00:11:55.210 --> 00:11:58.820
I feel most at ease in cramped, dark spaces.

00:11:59.400 --> 00:12:01.930
After all, I'm a vampire.

00:12:02.860 --> 00:12:05.450
Then, I'll be sleeping here.

00:12:05.450 --> 00:12:06.940
If you need anything...

00:12:14.670 --> 00:12:17.580
<i>I thought vampires were nocturnal.</i>

00:12:17.580 --> 00:12:19.460
<i>She must be exhausted.</i>

00:12:40.540 --> 00:12:45.300
<i>Am I headed in a crazy direction?</i>

00:12:47.010 --> 00:12:51.370
<i>But starting tonight, Mai and I 
are sleeping under the same roof.</i>

00:12:53.410 --> 00:12:58.420
<i>I'm living a bloody and dangerous 
life with a young vampire girl.</i>

00:12:58.420 --> 00:13:00.700
<i>It's like some kind of anime!</i>

00:13:01.960 --> 00:13:06.830
<i>I'm glad I'm a blood donating 
enthusiast with a blood fetish.</i>

00:13:07.550 --> 00:13:10.550
I'm so glad!

00:13:11.810 --> 00:13:14.570
<i>It is now time to leave school.</i>

00:13:14.110 --> 00:13:16.960
Doctor, I'm back for more.

00:13:14.570 --> 00:13:18.740
<i>Students who have no business at school 
are to leave school grounds immediately.</i>

00:13:16.960 --> 00:13:19.470
You again?

00:13:19.490 --> 00:13:24.120
<i>Students who do have business at school 
are to leave immediately, as well.</i>

00:13:20.020 --> 00:13:27.950
Seijuro High School Doctor
<b>Chihiro Chimatsuri</b>

00:13:20.270 --> 00:13:24.100
I'm only drawing your blood once a month.

00:13:24.100 --> 00:13:27.510
It's only been two weeks since last time.

00:13:24.120 --> 00:13:26.790
<i>Please just go home.</i>

00:13:28.100 --> 00:13:33.830
Besides, the blood I draw from 
you can't be given to anyone.

00:13:33.830 --> 00:13:37.830
I've explained it to you numerous 
times, but since it's important,

00:13:37.830 --> 00:13:42.540
I'll explain it to you again. 
Listen closely.

00:13:37.830 --> 00:13:42.550
<b>School Infirmary</b>

00:13:42.540 --> 00:13:45.690
What is a blood type?

00:13:45.690 --> 00:13:50.030
A technical explanation would bore 
you, and our time is limited,

00:13:50.030 --> 00:13:52.890
so you can look up the details on Wikipedia.

00:13:53.650 --> 00:13:58.930
Broadly speaking, the ABO blood 
group system beloved by the Japanese

00:13:58.930 --> 00:14:03.900
is used in order to avoid hemolysis 
during a blood transfusion.

00:14:03.900 --> 00:14:09.880
In extremely rare cases, a person's blood 
type can belong to multiple groups.

00:14:09.880 --> 00:14:12.280
This is known as chimerism.

00:14:12.280 --> 00:14:19.010
Naturally, chimera blood types can't be used 
in transfusions and therefore not collected.

00:14:19.010 --> 00:14:23.410
And your blood type is chimeric.

00:14:30.880 --> 00:14:32.880
I'm talking about you!

00:14:30.890 --> 00:14:32.890
<b>SLAP SLAP SLAP</b>

00:14:33.360 --> 00:14:36.360
Corporal punishment. Power harassment.

00:14:36.360 --> 00:14:40.900
How dare you nap when I'm considerately 
explaining your situation to you?!

00:14:40.900 --> 00:14:43.990
But you've told me so often, 
I'm sick of hearing it.

00:14:44.310 --> 00:14:47.110
In any case, once a month.

00:14:47.110 --> 00:14:49.250
Not more than that.

00:14:49.250 --> 00:14:52.490
I'll be fine. I'll eat plenty of spinach.

00:14:52.490 --> 00:14:55.340
I'll eat liver and prunes until I puke.

00:14:55.570 --> 00:14:58.210
Could you draw about a whole liter at once?

00:14:58.210 --> 00:14:59.830
You idiot. That would kill you.

00:14:59.830 --> 00:15:02.690
I don't care. Please, doctor.

00:15:04.160 --> 00:15:05.190
Is it a boy?

00:15:05.190 --> 00:15:05.980
Huh?

00:15:05.980 --> 00:15:07.590
Looks like I'm right.

00:15:07.590 --> 00:15:10.310
No, it's not like that.

00:15:10.310 --> 00:15:14.660
I'm the kind of man who 
wants to play Fallout 4

00:15:14.660 --> 00:15:18.600
on the PlayStation and eat 
extra large beef bowls.

00:15:18.600 --> 00:15:20.730
I'm an expensive man to keep around.

00:15:21.070 --> 00:15:23.410
That's what you're up to, isn't it?

00:15:23.410 --> 00:15:25.080
Selling blood is a crime.

00:15:25.080 --> 00:15:28.580
No. I'd never do anything so obscene.

00:15:28.580 --> 00:15:30.290
Besides, she—

00:15:30.290 --> 00:15:31.770
She?

00:15:32.860 --> 00:15:35.350
Fill me in on the details.

00:15:35.350 --> 00:15:39.670
Depending on the circumstances, I might 
be willing to draw a liter or two.

00:15:40.320 --> 00:15:42.990
Well, actually...

00:15:43.570 --> 00:15:47.590
I see. A wandering vampire girl.

00:15:47.590 --> 00:15:49.850
Not just a girl. A beautiful girl.

00:15:49.850 --> 00:15:52.880
You're not making this up, are you?

00:15:52.880 --> 00:15:55.220
It's true. It's all true.

00:15:55.220 --> 00:15:56.240
To prove it...

00:15:56.240 --> 00:15:58.300
Nice to meet you. I'm Mai.

00:15:59.340 --> 00:16:01.840
When did she get here?

00:16:01.840 --> 00:16:04.160
She is a vampire.

00:16:04.160 --> 00:16:10.330
I shall medically determine if this girl is 
a vampire or a human with a screw loose.

00:16:10.980 --> 00:16:13.700
Her heart is beating, so she's not a corpse.

00:16:14.440 --> 00:16:17.780
Her blood pressure is a bit low, 
but her levels are normal.

00:16:18.120 --> 00:16:20.280
She doesn't have fangs, 
much less a single cavity.

00:16:20.280 --> 00:16:22.460
She's in such perfect health, 
dentists hate her.

00:16:22.460 --> 00:16:25.270
How is this a vampire?

00:16:35.840 --> 00:16:40.270
Very well. I'll acknowledge that 
she isn't an ordinary human.

00:16:40.270 --> 00:16:41.990
I'm hungry.

00:16:41.990 --> 00:16:43.810
Please help me.

00:16:43.810 --> 00:16:46.730
If we can't use mine, 
then lend me your blood—

00:16:46.730 --> 00:16:48.000
I refuse.

00:16:48.000 --> 00:16:51.070
Doctor, don't you have a conscience?

00:16:51.070 --> 00:16:54.050
No. Nor do I have any morals.

00:16:54.050 --> 00:16:56.450
There's a human dying over here!

00:16:56.450 --> 00:16:58.370
She's not human.

00:16:59.980 --> 00:17:05.050
Mai is the first girl to receive my blood.

00:17:06.330 --> 00:17:09.990
Then protect your first.

00:17:09.990 --> 00:17:13.560
Anyway, I don't have any more time for you.

00:17:14.290 --> 00:17:21.010
Doctor, you said you only collect 
rare blood types, right?

00:17:21.010 --> 00:17:22.320
Indeed.

00:17:22.320 --> 00:17:28.480
Gathering and researching the world's 
rarest blood types is my life's work.

00:17:30.150 --> 00:17:33.080
We can discuss that at a later date.

00:17:33.080 --> 00:17:36.360
You'll draw my blood, won't you?

00:17:48.010 --> 00:17:49.170
Delicious.

00:17:49.170 --> 00:17:52.350
I want more. More.

00:17:52.350 --> 00:17:56.440
Sorry. Doctor Chihiro would 
only draw this much.

00:17:56.440 --> 00:17:58.880
But I'll have her draw more tomorrow.

00:17:58.880 --> 00:18:00.290
Promise?

00:18:00.290 --> 00:18:04.340
I promise. I'd do anything for you, Mai.

00:18:08.270 --> 00:18:10.230
Call me Mai.

00:18:13.390 --> 00:18:14.320
Mai.

00:18:16.640 --> 00:18:20.280
Blood. I want blood.

00:18:20.280 --> 00:18:22.220
I want more.

00:18:22.220 --> 00:18:26.680
I want more blood!

00:18:28.880 --> 00:18:33.740
<i>Blood donating enthusiast Mitsugu Bambam-san, 
please report to the infirmary immediately.</i>

00:18:33.840 --> 00:18:35.670
<b>Scoff Guffaw Sneer</b>

00:18:37.760 --> 00:18:38.800
<b>Contempt</b>

00:18:38.960 --> 00:18:40.730
Chihiro!

00:18:40.730 --> 00:18:42.480
You're here.

00:18:42.480 --> 00:18:44.490
What was up with that announcement?

00:18:44.490 --> 00:18:46.090
What about it?

00:18:46.090 --> 00:18:48.350
Not only did you expose my 
blood donating enthusiasm

00:18:48.350 --> 00:18:51.480
to the entire student body using 
the school broadcast system...

00:18:51.480 --> 00:18:55.270
Everybody knows that. What else?

00:18:55.270 --> 00:18:59.150
My name isn't Mitsugu Bambam!

00:18:57.030 --> 00:18:58.900
Mitsugu
Bamba

00:18:59.150 --> 00:19:01.640
It's Mitsugu Bamba!

00:18:59.400 --> 00:19:01.660
Mitsugu
Bam<b>ba</b>

00:19:01.910 --> 00:19:06.150
What kind of fool gets upset 
over one wrong letter?

00:19:06.150 --> 00:19:10.040
Do you have any idea how much suffering my 
ominous name has caused me since my youth?

00:19:10.040 --> 00:19:23.430
<b>Chihiro
Chimatsuri</b>

00:19:11.530 --> 00:19:14.550
Chihiro Chimatsuri is your real name?

00:19:14.550 --> 00:19:17.710
Why would a mere public health doctor 
like myself use a pseudonym?

00:19:17.710 --> 00:19:23.430
But I've kept my enthusiasm for 
giving blood a secret until now.

00:19:26.800 --> 00:19:28.320
I told you,

00:19:28.310 --> 00:19:30.770
<b>SLAP SLAP SLAP</b>

00:19:28.320 --> 00:19:30.770
everybody knows already!

00:19:31.530 --> 00:19:34.460
Corporal punishment. Power harassment.

00:19:34.770 --> 00:19:38.700
Morals is a word not found in my dictionary.

00:19:38.700 --> 00:19:45.440
I called you here to discuss 
yesterday's vampire girl.

00:19:45.440 --> 00:19:47.000
What about Mai?

00:19:47.310 --> 00:19:51.450
Fostering that malnourished 
girl won't be easy.

00:19:53.460 --> 00:20:00.880
No matter how hard you try, 
you'll just end up a desiccated husk.

00:20:00.880 --> 00:20:05.940
That's why I was hoping that as a 
blood-obsessed doctor, you'd give me a hand.

00:20:05.940 --> 00:20:11.320
I don't mind helping you, 
but helping you too much will kill me,

00:20:11.320 --> 00:20:14.010
and I'm certainly not interested 
in doing it for cheap.

00:20:14.350 --> 00:20:17.200
<i>The logic of one who's arrogant, 
if nothing else—</i>

00:20:17.190 --> 00:20:18.940
<b>SLAP SLAP SLAP</b>

00:20:18.940 --> 00:20:22.110
I know exactly what you're thinking!

00:20:22.110 --> 00:20:24.280
Anyway, I have a suggestion.

00:20:22.110 --> 00:20:31.790
<b>Self-censored</b>

00:20:23.990 --> 00:20:31.790
Artistically Necessary

00:20:24.280 --> 00:20:27.310
Start a Blood Donation Club.

00:20:27.310 --> 00:20:29.200
A Blood Donation Club?

00:20:29.670 --> 00:20:31.800
You mean give blood as a club activity?

00:20:31.790 --> 00:20:44.390
<b>Artistically
Necessary</b>

00:20:31.800 --> 00:20:33.900
If you openly draw blood at school,

00:20:33.900 --> 00:20:37.120
you'll be able to satisfy the 
demands of a vampire or two,

00:20:37.120 --> 00:20:45.070
and I can examine the blood for 
any rare blood types to collect.

00:20:45.070 --> 00:20:50.050
It's a true two-birds-with-one-stone 
double-the-fun win-win relationship.

00:20:50.060 --> 00:20:52.060
<b>Maneuver
Excessively Descriptive Platform</b>

00:20:52.420 --> 00:20:54.920
The sand on a beach may be finite,

00:20:54.920 --> 00:20:58.120
but the number of blood donating 
enthusiasts is infinite.

00:20:58.120 --> 00:21:03.700
You're not the only pervert who 
loves to give blood at this school.

00:21:06.400 --> 00:21:09.760
Students of Seijumonji High School!

00:21:06.410 --> 00:21:25.630
<b>Blood
Donation
Club</b>

00:21:09.760 --> 00:21:15.290
Why not donate your young blood to society?

00:21:15.290 --> 00:21:21.770
The Blood Donation Club needs 
your love, courage, and blood!

00:21:21.770 --> 00:21:25.650
Join the Blood Donation Club and 
enjoy an adolescence of blood love!

00:21:25.650 --> 00:21:31.480
You won't attract anyone by advertising 
yourself as a blood donation clinic.

00:21:31.480 --> 00:21:33.820
Should I do blood donation exercises?

00:21:33.820 --> 00:21:38.920
You need to appeal directly 
to the students' desires.

00:21:38.920 --> 00:21:41.760
Don't you care what happens 
to that vampire girl?

00:21:41.760 --> 00:21:43.890
Can you afford to be picky?

00:21:45.630 --> 00:21:50.750
Our advisor is the infirmary's 
dynamite Doctor Chihiro Chimatsuri!

00:21:50.750 --> 00:21:53.380
Enjoy the doctor's hospitable care!

00:21:53.380 --> 00:21:58.030
The Blood Donation Club has Korean 
hotties and blood transfusion mixers!

00:22:01.500 --> 00:22:06.670
<i>And that's how I became the blood collector</i>

00:22:06.670 --> 00:22:10.510
<i>who'd do anything for a slightly 
unusual girl named Mai.</i>

00:23:44.980 --> 00:23:59.990
<b>Episode 2 "Night Flight on Love"</b>

00:23:45.590 --> 00:23:50.320
This school is full of perverts who 
can't stay calm when they see blood.

00:23:50.320 --> 00:23:52.490
It's already quite late.

00:23:52.490 --> 00:23:54.800
Don't you think this is a bit much?

00:23:54.800 --> 00:23:58.720
Let's have another great night!
